<title>FINLAND: Metra 8-mth sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Metra 8-mth sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish diversified engineering group Metra Oy Ab on Wednesday gave the following breakdown of its January-August results (million markka):</p>
<p>    Net sales:		Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95   Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Wartsila Diesel		4,216	  3,333	   6,920</p>
<p> Sanitec			  1,754	  1,677	   2,496</p>
<p> Imatra Steel		     623	    627	     994</p>
<p> Other operations		  56	    170	     258</p>
<p> Intragroup sales		 -34	    -21	     -51</p>
<p> TOTAL			    6,615	  5,786	  10,617 @</p>
<p>    Operating profit:     Jan-Aug 96   Jan-Aug 95   Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p> Wartsila Diesel		   -48	   110	     385</p>
<p> Sanitec			     213	   240	     325</p>
<p> Imatra Steel			 71	    87	     173</p>
<p> Other operations		  273	    74	     117</p>
<p> TOTAL				 509	   511	   1,000</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
